title: Fake crash-repair lure
severity: high
score: 55
tags: clickfix, crashfix
attack: T1176.001, T1204.004
description: A non-vendor page shows a fake browser-crash / 'security issues detected'
  repair popup. It also writes a command to the clipboard or tells the visitor to paste one
  into Run. This is CrashFix / KongTuke, often after a malicious extension freezes the
  browser.
---
crash_repair_pages
| where exists(clipboard_commands) or exists(run_dialog_pages)
